<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Flo — the runtime for event-driven systems</title>
<meta name="description" content="Flo runs streams, key-value state, queues, time-series, actions and workflows in one binary, on one Raft-replicated log. The runtime for event-driven systems.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://floruntime.io/">

<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Flo — the runtime for event-driven systems">
<meta property="og:description" content="Streams, key-value state, queues, time-series, actions and workflows in one binary, on one Raft-replicated log.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://floruntime.io/">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:ital,wdth,wght@0,75..125,400..700;1,75..125,400..600&family=Inter:wght@400;450;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/landing.css">
</head>

<body>

<!-- =================== META =================== -->
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="meta">
    <div class="meta-brand">
      <a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/logo-flo-dark.svg" alt="" width="26" height="19"><span>Floruntime</span></a>
      <div>The runtime for event-driven systems</div>
    </div>
    <nav class="meta-links">
      <a href="/getting-started/introduction">[ DOCS ]</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/floruntime/flo" rel="noopener" aria-label="GitHub" class="gh-link">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27s1.36.09 2 .27c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8Z"/></svg>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <div class="rule"></div>

  <!-- =================== HERO =================== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow"># Event-driven runtime</div>
    <h1 class="display">Build event-driven systems on one log.</h1>
    <p class="lede lede-mono">One binary runs the streams, key-value state, queues, time-series, actions and workflows an event-driven system needs. The event, the state it changes and the work it triggers all commit to the same Raft-replicated log.</p>

    <div class="install">
      <code><span class="pr">$</span> curl -fsSL https://get.floruntime.io | sh</code>
      <button type="button" data-copy="curl -fsSL https://get.floruntime.io | sh" aria-label="Copy install command">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="1.5"/><path d="M5 15a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="/getting-started/quickstart">[ QUICK START → ]</a>
      <a class="dim" href="/architecture/overview">[ HOW IT WORKS ]</a>
      <span class="faint">brew install floruntime/tap/flo</span>
    </div>
  </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- =================== THE OBJECT =================== -->
<section class="object" id="the-object">
  <div class="object-head">
    <div class="eyebrow"># The unified append log</div>
    <h2>One log. Everything else is a projection.</h2>
    <p>Streams, key-value state, queues, time-series, actions and workflows are seven reads of the same Raft-replicated log. Nothing is copied between systems, because there is only one system.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="walk">

  <!-- =================== GET STARTED =================== -->
  <section class="get">
    <span class="plus plus-l" style="top:150px" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
    <span class="plus plus-r" style="top:150px" aria-hidden="true">+</span>

    <div class="get-head">
      <div class="kicker">[ GET STARTED ]</div>
      <h2>Every primitive<br>from <span class="knock">one client</span></h2>
      <p class="get-help">Need help? Read the <a href="/sdks/overview">SDK docs</a>, browse the <a href="/reference/wire-protocol">wire protocol</a>, or open an <a href="https://github.com/floruntime/flo/issues" rel="noopener">issue</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rail">
      <span class="plus plus-l" style="top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%)" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
      <span class="plus plus-r" style="top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%)" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
      <div class="rail-grid" role="tablist" aria-label="Client">
        <button class="rail-cell" role="tab" data-client="js" aria-selected="true">
